msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "May I have another potion? "
msgctxt "bark 0421:8CEF"
msgid "Aye, my friend, I have had time to concoct another. "
msgstr ""

#. event 01 (use (talk)), after "May I have another potion? "
